return {
    ["\n-----------------------------开始输出-----------------------------\n"] = "\n-----------------------------Start Output-----------------------------\n",
    ["        这个世界实在是太无聊了！连像样的小说也没有，更别提网文、游戏和电影了，只能靠我自己来写了。\n        穿越到这个世界已经很久了，自从成为“通识者”途径的非凡者后，我靠着魔药的力量完整地回想起以前学过的所有知识，赞美义务教育与我的二本学历！然后我大抄特抄……哦，是将先进的文化与知识传播到这个世界。\n        凭借着才华与魅力，贵族们拉拢我，教会也喜欢我，没落的古斯塔夫家族又一次站在这个王国的顶端，我那便宜老爹老妈真应该谢谢我。但也有些想念我真正的家，成为这个途径的非凡者也是为了找到回家的方法。黄涛啊黄涛，可不能忘了初衷，还是要勤奋提升序列。\n        那个“占卜家”途径的老骗子查拉图虽然教了我不少非凡知识，但一旦涉及到真正的隐秘，他就开始笑而不语，说来说去还是要我帮他去偷教会里那本安提哥努斯笔记。\n        再说一遍，等我成为高序列强者，看到一个占卜家就揍一个！"] = "This world is just too boring! There aren't even any decent novels, let alone web novels, games, or movies; I have to write them myself. \n It has been a long time since I transmigrated to this world. Ever since I became a Beyonder of the Savant pathway, I have been able to recall all the knowledge I learned before thanks to the power of the potion. Praise compulsory education and my undergraduate degree! Then I copied everything... oh, I mean, I spread advanced culture and knowledge to this world. \n Relying on my talent and charm, the nobles courted me, the churches liked me, and the declining Gustav family stood at the pinnacle of this kingdom once again. My cheap old man and mom really should thank me. But I also miss my real home; becoming a Beyonder of this pathway is also to find a way back home. Huang Tao, oh Huang Tao, you must not forget your original intention; you still need to diligently increase your Sequence. \n That old liar Zaratul of the Seer pathway taught me quite a bit of Beyonder knowledge, but whenever it involves true secrets, he starts smiling without a word, saying over and over that I need to help him steal that Antigonus Notebook from the church. \n Let me say it again: once I become a high-Sequence powerhouse, I will beat up every Seer I see!",
