    ["你前往廷根湖调查，在湖边遇到一对情侣因铜镜消失。市民失踪疑案愈发严重，你决定诵念咒语进入镜中廷根，救出罗珊和失踪市民。在镜中廷根里，你发现部分失踪市民已经异化成怪物，街头充斥着知识洪流与堕落母神的信徒。随后，你在工厂区救下紧守脚踏车的杰克、被知识控制的工厂主查理、女工珍妮，得知罗珊正引导众人逃往廷根大剧院“安全屋”。找到罗珊时她已濒临失控，邓恩、老尼尔、罗珊父亲等亡魂现身，以“我们是值夜者、是可怜虫、更是守护者”的呼唤唤醒了罗珊的理智。在安全屋前，你们遇到了幕后势力五月庄园的“管家”，你拼尽全力击退了管家召唤的“异变狼人”，但在伦纳德和弗莱赶来支援的最后一刻，“管家”戴上了污染的“知识皇冠”，凭借污染的力量逃匿。"] = "You go to Tingen Lake to investigate and meet a couple by the lake who are affected by the disappearance of the bronze mirror. The mysterious missing persons case becomes increasingly serious, and you decide to chant the incantation to enter Tingen in the Mirror to rescue Rozanne and the missing citizens. Inside Tingen in the Mirror, you discover that some of the missing citizens have mutated into monsters, and the streets are filled with the Torrent of Knowledge and followers of the Mother Goddess of Depravity. Subsequently, you save Jack, who is guarding his bicycle in the factory district, the factory owner Charlie, who is controlled by knowledge, and the worker Jenny, and learn that Rozanne is guiding everyone to escape to the \"Safe House\" at the Tingen Grand Theater. When you find Rozanne, she is on the verge of loss of control, and the souls of Dunn, Old Neil, Rozanne's father, and others appear, awakening Rozanne's sanity with the call, \"We are Nighthawks, we are poor wretches, and even more so, we are Guardians.\" In front of the safe house, you encounter the \"Butler\" from the May Manor, the mastermind behind the scenes. You try your best to repel the \"Mutated Werewolf\" summoned by the butler, but at the last moment when Leonard and Frye arrive to support, the \"Butler\" puts on the corrupted \"Knowledge Crown\" and escapes using the power of corruption.",
